# Widgets Layer

This directory contains composite UI blocks per Feature-Sliced Design (FSD).

Widgets are larger UI components that combine multiple features and entities:
- Dashboard layouts
- Headers and navigation bars
- Sidebars
- Complex forms that span multiple features

Example structure:
```
widgets/
  dashboard-header/
    ui/
      DashboardHeader.tsx
    index.ts
  auth-layout/
    ui/
      AuthLayout.tsx
    index.ts
```

Widgets can import from:
- ✅ features/
- ✅ entities/
- ✅ shared/

Widgets CANNOT import from:
- ❌ pages/
- ❌ app/
- ❌ other widgets/
